e-key` (fact-5f3bb044d7d2)，导致容器配置加载失败，抛出 `CreateContainerConfigError` (fact-65f78c62a2a0)。\n**证据支持：** Kubernetes Event 与 Container Waiting Message 提供了完全一致且详细的错误原因描述（fact-5f3bb044d7d2, fact-1d0bd3d4e906），且 Metric 状态（fact-324275e24c05）独立确认了该异常状态。现有事实已充分闭环，证据充足。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 12.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 61.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9: 61.1s (Evidence 53.7s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9**: pod-config-error, pod-notready-probe-failed, pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 85.433, "metrics": {"run_id": "0fdb49f46e5e41f9", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 85.43726634979248, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-notready-probe-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "l